Chain	4 × MAX7219 · 32 × 8 LEDs
Mode	on
Intensity	3 · 7/32
Scan limit	7 · all 8 rows
Decode	none: each bit an LED
Chips	all set alike
Last	register 9 = 00 on chip 0 · 4 loads
: clear ( -- ) 9 1 do i 0 all loop ;  ok.
clear  ok.
